 committee project decisions."}],"plainSummary":"This bill extends a federal program that sends payments to rural counties containing national forests and other federal land. The money helps fund local schools, roads, and municipal services. The bill provides payments through fiscal year 2026, including back payments for 2024 and 2025, and allows counties and advisory committees to continue initiating projects through 2028.","classificationMethod":"llm","plain":{"whoItTouches":"People who use public land, and people who live beside it.","confidence":"crs-summary"},"topOverlap":{"bioguideId":"S001181","score":0.014277792052191585},"overlapCount":27},"meaning":{"percentile":18.74901279418733,"median":0.010636331736930488,"n":6331,"ordinary":[],"unattributedShare":0.9088554574461727}},{"billId":"119-s-4429","bioguideId":"H001089","cycle":2026,"score":0.003097338459075387,"matches":[{"industry":"manufacturing","donorAmount":12000,"donorShare":0.005575209226335696,"billConfidence":0.5,"contribution":0.003097338459075387}],"method":{"formula":"score = Σ_industries ( donorShare(industry) × billWeight(industry) ), where billWeight = classifierConfidence / Σ classifierConfidence. Range 0–1, read as a weighted share of disclosed itemized money.","donorProfileCycle":2026,"billClassificationMethod":"keyword-fallback","unclassifiedDonorShare":0.9088554574461727},"bill":{"id":"119-s-4429","congress":119,"billType":"s","billNumber":"4429","title":"Connected Vehicle Security Act of 2026","introducedDate":"2026-04-29","latestActionDate":"2026-07-22","latestActionText":"Committee on Commerce, Science, and Transportation. Ordered to be reported with an amendment in the nature of a substitute favorably.","policyArea":"Foreign Trade and International Finance","subjects":[],"sponsorBioguideId":"M001242","cosponsorCount":31,"committeeNames":[],"congressDotGovUrl":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/senate-bill/4429","industries":[{"industry":"manufacturing","confidence":0.5,"rat